[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5486778021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123057#issuecomment-5486778021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123057","id":5486778021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRwmWpQ","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T00:37:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T00:37:51Z","body":"I didn’t see the proposal earlier, so commenting here. there’s something about seeing the full inheritance chain in the inspector that feels logical and perhaps even important to me, but i will also immediately admit that i think any category with no properties doesn’t have to be shown in the inspector per sé because there is nothing actionable. so that leaves me with the question: is the inspector a place where a developer looks to see the inheritance chain or not? where else can a dev see that chain at a glance?\r\n\r\ni looked at the code and saw that this is implemented by specially looking at refco